WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Light Edge ends the prerequisite OD-Arc juggle.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.300
Standing medium kick intentionally whiffs.

3
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:01.950
Standing heavy kick hits Ryu during wake-up.

4
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.400
Standing medium punch links into the heavy target.

5
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.800
OD Arc Step extends the new conversion.

6
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.900
Sprint launcher continues the juggle.

7
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.450
Light Edge finishes at the wall.

8
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:06.950
Ryu falls after the completed conversion.
